WEBVTT

00:36:28.538 --> 00:36:30.788
And one day she mentioned that
she went to Ohio State.

00:36:31.329 --> 00:36:36.246
And my first reaction was, yuck. Yeah,
I'm a Michigan Wolverine.

00:36:36.413 --> 00:36:40.538
We're rivals, but who cares where she
went to school half a century ago?

00:36:40.579 --> 00:36:43.079
Yeah, it just bothered me
at a fundamental level.

00:36:43.204 --> 00:36:47.496
And so I decided, you know, like any
self respecting social scientist,

00:36:47.496 --> 00:36:51.788
I should study that. And so Tim and
I and all these experiments with

00:36:51.788 --> 00:36:54.996
the Yankees and Red Sox fans, which was
such an easy rivalry to choose.

00:36:55.413 --> 00:36:58.954
And I think my my biggest
surprise was that two of

00:36:58.954 --> 00:37:02.163
the steps that were supposed to work
based on all the existing science,